To descend from current (a whole number).
Set spot to current.
The right is item current of rights.
If right is at least 0 and item right of values is more than desired, Descend from right.

The root is 0.
If desired is more than item 0 of values.
Set item 4 of values to desired.
Set item 4 of lefts to root.
Set item 4 of rights to -1.
