The queue is a list of 16 zeros.
Set item 0 of queue to root.
The head is 0, while the count is 1.
The order is an empty list of whole numbers.
Repeat while head is less than count.
The node is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
If node is less than 0, Place -1 into order.
If node is at least 0.
